<title>SRI LANKA: Prince Charles tops Sri Lanka party guest list.</title>
<headline>Prince Charles tops Sri Lanka party guest list.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Prince Charles will be the chief guest at Sri Lanka's 50th independence anniversary celebrations next year, the foreign ministry said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The statement did not give details.</p>
<p>Sri Lanka, formerly Ceylon, won independence from Britain on February 4, 1948.</p>
